<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/77cda98b-0bfb-455a-8915-f9c8d80bea16-01/Reviewer/ORG-0002>
  epo:contextualisedBy <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/77cda98b-0bfb-455a-8915-f9c8d80bea16-01/Lot/LOT-0001>,
    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/77cda98b-0bfb-455a-8915-f9c8d80bea16-01/Lot/LOT-0002>,
